{
    "title": "\u0645\u0644\u0648\u062f\u06cc\u0641\u0627\u06cc | \u0645\u0631\u062c\u0639 \u062a\u062e\u0635\u0635\u06cc \u0622\u0647\u0646\u06af",
    "description": "<h1> <b> Experience the easiest and most different way to download and play music offline without the need for the Internet with Melody! </b> </h1>\r\n\r\n<b> Advanced Search </b>\r\n\u2022 Smart search on songs, singers, albums with the help of artificial intelligence\r\n<b> Download Manager </b>\r\n\u2022 Ability to add a large number of songs to the download and public download list of songs by downloading the professional manager and playing them offline\r\n\u2022 Ability to download happy songs, sad songs, dance songs, new songs, old songs and nostalgia, songs of the 60s, traditional songs and dozens of other modes and styles in one and easy\r\n\u2022 Ability to folders when downloading songs\r\n\u2022 Play and download songs in three quality 320-160-96 for the first time\r\n<b> Playlists </b>\r\n\u2022 Thousands of dedicated playlists and very diverse in genres\r\nComplete collections of local music (for the first time) including: Lori songs, Turkish songs, Arabic songs, North, South, Kurdish, Gilaki, Qashqai, Bakhtiari, etc.\r\nConstant and daily updates of playlists\r\n<b> Other features </b>\r\n\u2022 Ability to view the lyrics\r\n\u2022 Ability to play and download the best songs of the day, week and month individually and play them offline\r\n\u2022 Ability to download a collection (example: birthday playlist) together\r\n\u2022 Search and sort downloaded music\r\n\u2022 Continuous updating and upgrading of the application",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h1> <b> Experience the easiest and most different way to download and play music offline without the need for the Internet with Melody! </b> </h1><br><br><b> Advanced Search </b><br>\u2022 Smart search on songs, singers, albums with the help of artificial intelligence<br><b> Download Manager </b><br>\u2022 Ability to add a large number of songs to the download and public download list of songs by downloading the professional manager and playing them offline<br>\u2022 Ability to download happy songs, sad songs, dance songs, new songs, old songs and nostalgia, songs of the 60s, traditional songs and dozens of other modes and styles in one and easy<br>\u2022 Ability to folders when downloading songs<br>\u2022 Play and download songs in three quality 320-160-96 for the first time<br><b> Playlists </b><br>\u2022 Thousands of dedicated playlists and very diverse in genres<br>Complete collections of local music (for the first time) including: Lori songs, Turkish songs, Arabic songs, North, South, Kurdish, Gilaki, Qashqai, Bakhtiari, etc.<br>Constant and daily updates of playlists<br><b> Other features </b><br>\u2022 Ability to view the lyrics<br>\u2022 Ability to play and download the best songs of the day, week and month individually and play them offline<br>\u2022 Ability to download a collection (example: birthday playlist) together<br>\u2022 Search and sort downloaded music<br>\u2022 Continuous updating and upgrading of the application",
